[[File:Map014.png|center|350px]]
'''Between Truth and Lies''' (真なる虚実を紡ぐ道, ''Shin Naru Kyojitsu o Tsumugu Michi'', '''Road that Weaves the Real Truth''') is the 47th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 96th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Vastly spikes in difficulty, with stages in this subchapter proving quite tedious, combining the worst [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. It also features another return of [[Relic Bun-Bun]] with [[Lowkey|ranged]] [[Great Angel Chibinel|support]].
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
While not his first appearance in-game, [[Wild Doge]] is introduced to Uncanny Legends here. He has high overall stats, almost no backswing, [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]] and a 30% chance to [[Survive|survive]] a lethal strike.

The last stage also reintroduces a mechanic previously unique to [[Archaeology 301: Planning]], where some enemies only spawn after a set number of [[Cat Units]] have been defeated.

